msgctxt "92"
msgid ""
"Guess what! So those guys who were threatening my dad?\r\n"
"They suddenly up and left Downtown Ryukyu for good!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid ""
"Dad even went to their office with his lawyer, and it was\r\n"
"completely deserted."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"Oh, Haruko, that's wonderful! Now you don't have to move to\r\n"
"Tokushima anymore!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"We can't get back the money they took, but at least there\r\n"
"won't be any more psychos pounding on our door."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"People around town are saying that this big, ripped,\r\n"
"scary-looking old guy really taught those guys a lesson."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid ""
"Well I think those coins we tossed in the river really made\r\n"
"our wishes come true!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid "Maybe, huh? And if that's the case..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid ""
"This could be the last of the Seven Mysteries of Downtown\r\n"
"Ryukyu. We had the cursed lockers, the Golden Agu pork..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid ""
"And now, if three people stand on the bridge and toss a coin\r\n"
"into the river, they'll get their wishes granted..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid ""
"Oh my gosh. We just made up one of the Seven Mysteries!\r\n"
"Hahahahaha!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid ""
"All this excitement's got me starving! Let's go grab some\r\n"
"goya burgers!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid ""
"(Could that \"ripped, scary-looking old guy\" they were\r\n"
"talking about... be me?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid "(Huh? There's something under the railing...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid ""
"(Must be a lucky coin. I'll keep it as compensation for getting to the "
"bottom of all those mysteries.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid "You picked up a <Color:8>Lucky Coin<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

